WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Smile in the Speaking test; tone is also assessed.. In Speaking, clarity beats

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
speed.. Fill every blank in the last ten minutes of the exam.. Read each answer

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
twice; question types hide traps.. Never try a new strategy on exam day; apply

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
what you know.. Test your headphone volume before the audio begins.. Count the

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
questions you flagged so you can return to them.. Take mocks at the same hour to

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
train your body clock.. Nerves are normal; three deep breaths slow your rhythm..

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Do not burn energy debating answers after the exam..
